#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:15
#: 05323964145140358e1172d189ac6eae a013538dff324e5187d8fc897cacda62
#: d1be050a3159489dbb816510be65cb76 e44575f33959487d98c043c7753d1214
#: eff987161eac471a8aec9543c8958055
msgid ""
"The *OpenGrab EPM v3* (from NicaDrone.com) is a small (less than 4cm x 4cm x"
" 2cm) Electro Permanent Magnet gripper capable of 200N of force meaning it "
"can hold about 15kg of cargo securely. The gripping and releasing of the "
"cargo is accomplished by delivering a short pulse to an electromagnet which "
"reverses it's field. Objects that it grips onto should be metal or have the "
"included `thin steel target square "
"<http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=15&controller=product>`__ "
"attached to them."
msgstr ""
"*OpenGrab EPM v3*（来自 NicaDrone.com）是一款小型（小于 4cm x 4cm x 2cm）电永磁抓手，可产生 200N "
"的吸附力，能牢固地抓持约 15kg 的货物。货物的抓取与释放通过向电磁铁施加短脉冲来实现，短脉冲会使磁场反向。所吸附的物体应为金属材质，或附有随附的 "
"`薄钢靶方块 <http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=15&controller=product>`__。"

